/* The modern skin's look shared by every document: the font, the entries of the menus and the button prompts. Sizes
   are in dp: one dp is one pixel at 720 lines, scaled with the window and the player's UI scale option.

   The look's type scale (docs/architecture/ui.md, «Escala tipográfica»): five sizes, and no other for its own texts.
     14dp  captions: button prompts and their keys, hints, small labels of the HUD, column headings
     18dp  body: menu entries, messages
     22dp  labels and values: list rows, rows of a page, section headings
     30dp  titles: a panel's title, the map's name
     48dp  display: big numbers
   Texts in the original's font (the original-look family) keep whole multiples of its 11-pixel cell (22dp, 33dp), the
   only sizes it draws sharp. */

body {
	font-family: "Noto Sans";
	font-weight: normal;
	font-size: 18dp;
	color: #e8edf3;
}

button {
	padding: 9dp 18dp;
	margin: 3dp 0;
	border-radius: 8dp;
	color: #c9d3de;
	background-color: transparent;
	transition: background-color color 0.12s cubic-out;
}

button:focus {
	background-color: #f0a73a;
	color: #1a1f27;
}

button:active {
	background-color: #ffc36b;
}

/* A button prompt: the name of the key or gamepad button that does something. */
.key {
	display: inline-block;
	min-width: 18dp;
	padding: 1dp 8dp;
	margin-right: 6dp;
	border-radius: 5dp;
	border: 1dp #c9d3de;
	font-weight: bold;
	font-size: 14dp;
	text-align: center;
	color: #e8edf3;
}
